  "job_B3.2.26_20251003_114628": {
    "text": "DOMINICA PASCHA.\nMen \u00fea leofestan, \u00feis eastorlice geryno us \u00e6teowe\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s ecean lifes sweotole bysene, swa we nu gehyran\nHim bi\u00fe beforan andweard eal engla cynn & manna cynn, & eac swylce werigra gasta.\n& \u00fe\u00e6r beo\u00f0 asmeade \u00e6ghwylces mannes d\u00e6da.\n& se \u00fee nu bi\u00fe ea\u00femod & gemyndig Drihtnes \u00ferowunge & his \u00e6riste ealle mode, se sceal heofonlicre\n& se \u00fee nu forhoga\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes bebodu healde, o\u00fe\u00fee \u00e6nig gemynd h\u00e6bbe Drihtnes ea\u00femodnesse, se\n\u00deonne is \u00feeos tid ealra tida hehst & halgost, & on \u00feas tid we sceolan habban godcunde blisse & eac\nSwa se witga Dauid be \u00feisse tide witgade, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Ure Drihten us gefreolsode.\n& he geendode \u00fe\u00e6t he lange to \u00fe\u00e6m awergdum gastum gebeotod h\u00e6fde, & he mannum gecy\u00fede on \u00feas\nUuton nu gehyran & ge\u00feencean hw\u00e6t he dyde, & mid hwy he us freo gedyde.\nN\u00e6s he mid n\u00e6nigum nede geb\u00e6ded, ac he mid his sylfes willan to eor\u00fean astag, & her manige setunga\n& \u00fea \u00e6t nehstan he let his lichoman on rode mid n\u00e6glum gef\u00e6stnian, & dea\u00fe he ge\u00ferowode for us,\n& he \u00fea onsende his \u00feone wuldorf\u00e6stan gast to helle grunde, & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feone ealdor ealra \u00feeostra & \u00fe\u00e6s\nHie \u00fea swi\u00fee forhte & abregde \u00feus cw\u00e6don: Hwonon is \u00fees \u00feus strang, & \u00feus beorht, & \u00feus egesfull?\nSe middangeard \u00fee us w\u00e6s lange \u00e6r under\u00feeoded, & us dea\u00fe mycel gafol geald.\nNe gelomp hit na \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t us swylc dea\u00fe geendod w\u00e6re, ne us n\u00e6fre swylc ege ne wear\u00fe \u00e6r to helle\nEala nu hw\u00e6t is \u00fees \u00fee \u00feus unforht g\u00e6\u00fe on ure gem\u00e6ro?\n& nis no \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t he him ure witu ondr\u00e6de, ac he wile eac o\u00fere of urum bendum alesan.\nWene we sy \u00feis se \u00fee we wendon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurh his dea\u00fe us sceolde beon eall middangeard under\u00feeoded.\nGehyrstu ure aldor?\n\u00deis is se ilca \u00fee \u00feu longe for his dea\u00fee plegodest, & \u00feu us \u00e6t endest\u00e6fe mycel herereaf gehete.\nAc hw\u00e6t wilt \u00feu his nu don?\n& hw\u00e6t miht \u00feu his onwendan?\nNu he hafa\u00fe ealle \u00feine \u00feeostro mid his beorhtnesse geflemed, & eal \u00fein carcern he hafa\u00fe tobrocen, & \u00fea\nTohwon l\u00e6ddest \u00feu hider \u00feeosne \u00fee on his cyme ealle his gecorene he hafa\u00fe to \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6rran blisse\n\u00deeah hie \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6s ecan lifes orwene w\u00e6ron, hie synt nu swi\u00fee bli\u00fee.\nNis her nu n\u00e6nig wop ne n\u00e6nig heaf gehyred, swa hit \u00e6r gewunelic w\u00e6s on \u00feisse wite stowe.\nEala nu, \u00feu ure aldor, \u00fea \u00feine welan \u00fee \u00feu on fruman begeate \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6restan mannes egeleasnesse &\n\u00deonne \u00feu wysctest \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu wistest Crist on rode ahangenne, nystest \u00feu no hu monige earfo\u00fea us eallum\n\u00deu woldest symle \u00feone besmitan \u00fee \u00feu nan wiht yfles on nystest.\nTohwon l\u00e6ddest \u00feu \u00feeosne freone & unscyldigne hider?\nNu he hafa\u00fe on his hidercyme ealle scyldige fordemde & gehynde.\n\u00dea sona \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fee seo arlease helwarena stefn w\u00e6s gehyred & heora gnornung, \u00fea w\u00e6s buton \u00e6lcere\n& \u00fea sona inst\u00e6pes seo unarimedlice menigo haligra saula \u00fee \u00e6r geh\u00e6ftnede w\u00e6ron to \u00fe\u00e6m H\u00e6lende\n\u00deu sealdest on eor\u00fean mannum synna forgifnessa.\nAles us nu of deofles onwalde & of helle h\u00e6ftnede.\nNu \u00feu for us astige on helle grund, ne forl\u00e6t \u00feu us nu on witum wunian, \u00feonne \u00feu to \u00feinum uplican rice\n\u00d0u asettest \u00feines wuldres myrecels on worlde, sete nu \u00fein wuldres tacn in helle.\nN\u00e6s \u00fea n\u00e6nig ylding to\u00feon \u00fea \u00feeos ben w\u00e6s gehyred, \u00fea sona seo unarimede menigo haligra saula mid\n\u00dea halgan sawla \u00fea mid unasecggendlicum gefean cleopodan to Drihtne, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00feon: Astig nu,\nGecy\u00fe nu middangearde blisse \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feinum upstige geblissian & gehyhton ealle \u00feine gecorenan.\nAdam \u00feagyt & Eua n\u00e6ron onlysde, ah on bendum hie w\u00e6ron h\u00e6fde.\nAdam \u00fea wependre stefne & earmlicre cegde to Drihtne, & cw\u00e6\u00fe: Miltsa me, Drihten; miltsa me for\nIc gedwolede swa swa \u00fe\u00e6t sceap \u00fe\u00e6t forwear\u00fe.\nSec nu \u00feinne \u00feeow, Drihten, for\u00feon \u00fee \u00feine handa me geworhtan & geheowodan.\nNe forl\u00e6t \u00feu mine saule mid hellwarum; ac do on me \u00feine mildheortnesse, & al\u00e6d me ut of \u00feyssum\nDrihten H\u00e6lend \u00fea w\u00e6s miltsigende Adame, & ra\u00fee his bendas w\u00e6ron onlysde.\n& befealden to H\u00e6lendes cneowum, he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Min saul bletsa\u00fe Drihten; & ealle mine \u00fea inneran his\n\u00deu \u00fee arf\u00e6st eart geworden eallum minum unrihtwisnessum, \u00feu \u00fee geh\u00e6ldest mine adla, & min lif of\nEua \u00feagyt on bendum & owope \u00feurhwunode; heo cw\u00e6\u00fe: So\u00fef\u00e6st eart \u00feu, Drihten, & rihte syndon\nAc \u00feu Drihten scyld minre iugo\u00fee & min, onunwisdomes ne wes \u00feu gemyndig, ne ne ahwyrf \u00feu \u00feine\nDrihten, \u00feu wast mine geheowunga, \u00fe\u00e6t ic eom dust & axe, gif \u00feu mine unrihtwisnesse behealdest.\nIc \u00fee halsige nu, Drihten, for \u00feinre \u00feeowene, Sancta Marian, \u00fea \u00feu mid heofonlicum wuldre\nHire inno\u00fe \u00feu gefyldest nigon mona\u00fe mid ealles middangeardes weor\u00fee; \u00feu wast \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu of minre\nAra me nu, min Drihten, for hire wuldres weor\u00femyndum, ara me unges\u00e6ligost ealra wifa, & min\nDrihten H\u00e6lend \u00fea w\u00e6s miltsiende Euan, & ra\u00fee hire bendas w\u00e6ron onlysede.\nHeo cleopode \u00fea & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Sy \u00fein nama, Drihten, gebletsad on worlde; for\u00feon \u00fee \u00fein mildheortnes\nAbraham \u00fea se heahf\u00e6der, mid eallum \u00feam halgum saulum \u00fee fram worlde fruman geh\u00e6ftnede\nMid \u00feon \u00fee Drihten \u00fea \u00fea herehyh\u00fe \u00fee on helle genumen h\u00e6fde, ra\u00fee he lifgende ut eode of his\n& he hine his gingrum \u00e6teowde, for\u00feon \u00fee he wolde \u00e6lcne tweon of heora heortum adon.\n& he eac \u00e6teowde \u00fea wunda & \u00feara n\u00e6gla dolh \u00fe\u00e6m ungeleaffullum mannum, for\u00feon \u00fee he nolde \u00fe\u00e6t\n& \u00fea \u00e6fter \u00feon on manigra manna gesyh\u00fee he astag on heofenas, & he ges\u00e6t Godf\u00e6der on \u00fea swi\u00feran\nUton we ealle wynsumian on Drihten we \u00fee his \u00e6riste m\u00e6rsia\u00fe; for\u00feon \u00fee he his godcundnesse nan\nNu we gehyra\u00fe, men \u00fea leofestan, hu manigfeald \u00feing Drihten for us ge\u00ferowode, \u00fea he us mid his\nUton we for\u00feon ge\u00feencean hwylc handlean we him for\u00fe to berenne habban, \u00feonne he eal \u00feis rec\u00fe &\nUton nu ge\u00feencean hu mycel egsa gelimpe\u00fe eallum gesceaftum on \u00feas ondweardan tid, \u00feonne se dom\nOn \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6ge gewite\u00fe heofon & eor\u00fee, & s\u00e6, & ealle \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee on \u00fe\u00e6m syndon, swa eac for \u00fe\u00e6re\n& seo rod ures Drihtnes bi\u00f0 ar\u00e6red on \u00fe\u00e6t gewrixle \u00feara tungla, seo nu on middangearde awergde\n& on \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6ge heofon bi\u00fe befealden swa swa boc, & on \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6ge eor\u00fee bi\u00fe forb\u00e6rned to axan, &\n\u00dey \u00e6restan d\u00e6ge on midne d\u00e6g gelimpe\u00fe mycel gnornung ealra gesceafta, & men gehyra\u00fe myccle\nOn \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fteran d\u00e6ge bi\u00fe gehyred mycel stefn on heofenum fyrdweorodes getrymnesse, & eor\u00fee bi\u00fe\n& mycel m\u00e6gen for\u00fecyme\u00fe \u00feurh \u00feone openan d\u00e6l, & \u00feone heofon ofor\u00feec\u00fe & oforwryh\u00fe \u00e6t \u00e6fen; &\n& seo heofon bi\u00fe gefeallen \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m feower endum middangeardes; & eall eor\u00fee bi\u00f0 mid \u00feeostrum\n& \u00feonne cwe\u00fe eall folc; Arige us nu & miltsige se Drihten \u00fee on engla endebyrdnesse w\u00e6s gehered,\n\u00dea cleopodan hie & \u00feus cw\u00e6don: Wuldor sy Gode on heanessum & mannum on eor\u00fean \u00feam \u00fee godes\n\u00dey \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge seo eor\u00fee on \u00fe\u00e6m nor\u00feende & on \u00feam eastende spreca\u00fe him betweonum; & \u00fea\n\u00deonne bi\u00fe eall eor\u00fean m\u00e6gen onwended, & mycel eor\u00fehrernes bi\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6ge geworden.\n\u00dey feor\u00fean d\u00e6ge ofor undern beo\u00fe myccle \u00feuneras on heofnum; & \u00feonne gefealla\u00fe ealle deofolgyld.\n& \u00feonne hit bi\u00fe \u00e6t sunnan setlgange, & \u00feeah hwe\u00fere n\u00e6nig leoht ne \u00e6teowe\u00fe; & mona bi\u00fe adw\u00e6sced;\n\u00dey fiftan d\u00e6ge \u00e6t underne se heofon tobyrst from \u00fe\u00e6m eastd\u00e6le o\u00fe \u00feone westd\u00e6l; & \u00feonne eall engla\n\u00deonne geseo\u00fe ealle menn \u00fe\u00e6t hit wile beon \u00e6t \u00feisse worlde ende.\nFleo\u00fe \u00feonne to muntum & hie hyda\u00f0 for \u00feara engla onsyne, & \u00feonne cwe\u00fea\u00fe to \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00fean, &\nSwa hit geara be \u00feon on Cristes bocum gewitgod w\u00e6s, & \u00feus cwe\u00fea\u00fe: Eadige syndon \u00fea men \u00fea \u00fee\n& \u00feonne hie cwe\u00fea\u00fe to \u00fe\u00e6m dunum & to \u00fe\u00e6m hyllum: Fealla\u00fe ofor us, & us bewreo\u00fe & gehyda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t\nNu is eal gesyne \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00e6r behyded h\u00e6fdon.\n\u00dey syxtan d\u00e6ge \u00e6r underne \u00feonne bi\u00fe from feower endum \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00fean eall middangeard mid\n& \u00feonne he cyme\u00fe \u00feonne beota\u00fe he \u00fe\u00e6t he wile \u00fea saula sendan on ece witu \u00fea \u00fee him heran nella\u00fe;\nSwa \u00feonne \u00fey d\u00e6ge cyme\u00fe Sanctus Michahel mid heofonlicum \u00fereate haligra gasta, & \u00fea \u00feonne\n\u00deonne geseo\u00fe ealle gesceafta ures Drihtnes mihte, \u00feeah \u00fee hie nu mennisce men oncnawan nellan ne\n\u00deonne \u00e6fter \u00feeossum \u00feingum bi\u00fe neh \u00fe\u00e6m seofo\u00fean d\u00e6ge; & \u00feonne hate\u00fe Sanctus Michahel se\nEalle hie sceolan \u00feonne arisan, & for\u00fegan to \u00feam dome, on swylcum heowe swa hie hie \u00e6r hie sylfe\nN\u00e6s na mid golde ne mid godwebbenum hr\u00e6glum, ac mid godum d\u00e6dum & halgum we sceolan beon\nFor\u00feon we sceolan nu ge\u00feencean, \u00fea hwile \u00fee we magan & motan, ure saula \u00feearfe, \u00fee l\u00e6s we\nUton beon ea\u00femode & mildheorte & \u00e6lmesgeorne, facen & leasunga & \u00e6feste from urum heortum\n& swa myccle swa \u00fe\u00e6s mannes miht beo mare, & he bi\u00fe weligra on \u00feisse worlde, swa him \u00feonne se\nUton nu, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feas \u00feing ge\u00feencean swi\u00fee snotorlice & wislice, \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feurh so\u00fef\u00e6ste",
